    `Total Enrollment (Ages 10-15)` double precision, -- Total Enrollment (Ages 10-15) Example values: ['500.0', '1800.0', '1000.0']
    `School Category` text, --  Example values: ['Charter Schools', 'Private Schools', 'Magnet Schools']
